.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH login 1  "login " 
.SH NAME
login \- Log in to a `ForgeHub` server (device\-code flow in the browser)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlogin\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-\-token\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Log in to a `ForgeHub` server (device\-code flow in the browser)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH CLOUD
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR
Read an API token from stdin instead of the device flow (for CI)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg login
  fg login \-\-registry https://forgehub.example.com
